sequenceDiagram
    participant AI as AI tool
    participant MCP as design-dawn-mcp
    participant Disk as Project files
    AI->>MCP: getBlock
    MCP->>Disk: Read body
    MCP-->>AI: Text and contentHash
    AI->>MCP: updateBlock (expectedContentHash)
    MCP->>Disk: Check current hash
    alt Unchanged
        MCP->>Disk: Write
        MCP-->>AI: written
    else Changed by someone else
        MCP-->>AI: conflict
    end
